{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1700.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"0987b957689c61c81921527cd0e3e33f08f7b0f3d40b6c39266cd1d51fa3e8f9","ja":"ねぇねぇ、このみん、どゆこと？\n温泉入るのに、なんで衣装に着替えるの？","zh":"我说我说，木美姐，这是怎么回事啊？\n明明是要泡温泉，为什么要换上演出服呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1700.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"82ec8e3d4cb5132bd3958d1898b7cb5dbe7b7173ab1984b52f2fa70a84dc3bfc","ja":"うーん……。\n旅館の前で建物の紹介をするとかかしら……？","zh":"嗯……\n是在旅馆前介绍建筑之类的方式吗……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1700.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"01a4b45215134248ae382a058f7c6818a90bad332a92f4d198c4c0e6c5c56c53","ja":"「到着しました！\nこの街で、温泉以外の魅力を探していただきます！」","zh":"「我们到了！\n请大家在这座城市里，寻找温泉以外的魅力吧！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1700.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"db3ec9d6d19682bfc35e26937159a2ee4810550b45701bb012591452adcde20e","ja":"ええ～～～っ！！","zh":"诶诶～～～！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1700.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"8b2bfd438109cb63665b2551b74281c066edf5a2c0794f416c6dcb71cb58667c","ja":"温泉以外の魅力って、どういうこと！？\nこーんなに、いい温泉があるのにー。","zh":"温泉以外的魅力，到底是什么意思啊！？\n明明有这么棒的温泉在——","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1700.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"7501ba1e916cefc5e430c1b564d8b9217af1d78f90549f1b6caa584e027faa7e","ja":"私たち、温泉のレポートするんじゃないんですか？","zh":"我们不是来给温泉做报道的吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1700.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"0405428deb3e9ab907ed2217ffdd6ac3222445bfa59cd92c16d5ea9c4defefa2","ja":"「はい。『その街の、まだ知られていない魅力を\n探す』という企画なので……」","zh":"「是的。因为这是一档『寻找那座城市\n尚未为人所知的魅力』的企划……」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1700.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"d67c8787f9ee3d9c87503d20ec2a438b271296cde53186b938093f439e4fcf4f","ja":"ええっ！　勘違いだったってこと～！？","zh":"咦咦！　原来只是搞错了吗～！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1700.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"2eb6192136833e8f686211e0d487a92e3a3f0ac193cc1c8773761dd78aad5587","ja":"やっちゃったわ……。\nバタバタしてて、ちゃんと把握できてなかったわね。","zh":"搞砸了呢……\n手忙脚乱的，都没能好好掌握情况呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1700.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"17f1a1d242270ac67bf5a3c4f601ad12a6598b1f7cd1869933df12d394ecf569","ja":"「すみません、こちらの連絡不足です。\nロケ、よろしいでしょうか？」","zh":"「不好意思，是我这边沟通不到位。\n可以开始外景拍摄了吗？」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1700.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"c9dd4182fdb5af4cb454c1b02391779cb9fe98a8ebe341afed10e0effc6807a9","ja":"えっ？　あ、はい。\n問題なくできます……ね、真美ちゃん！","zh":"哎？啊，好的。\n完全没问题……对吧，真美！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1700.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"c9e477cfaccbb5baa7c4c1662413fda29b66db78086048d158781a8b225bbb8c","ja":"モチのロンだよ！　こうなったら、\nどっちが街のミリキを伝えられるか対決だかんね！","zh":"那还用说！既然这样，\n就来比比看谁更能把小镇的魅力传达给大家吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1700.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"8a6975fa9c2251a5bf544e7349da3cbf56257b71225eff0d13fe1d9e1af3c145","ja":"受けて立つわ！　それじゃあさっそく、\n地元の人に、オススメを聞いてみましょ。","zh":"我接受挑战！那么事不宜迟，\n去问问当地人有什么推荐吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
